function exEscape(value){return String(value==null?'':value).replace(/[&<>"']/g,exChar=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[exChar]));}
function exIcons(){if(typeof lucide!=='undefined')lucide.createIcons({attrs:{'stroke-width':1.6}});}
function exButton(text,call,kind='',disabled=false,hint=''){return `<span class="stack" style="gap:4px"><button class="btn ${kind}" onclick="${exEscape(call)}" ${disabled?'disabled':''} ${hint?`title="${exEscape(hint)}"`:''}>${text}</button>${disabled&&hint?`<span class="muted xs">${hint}</span>`:''}</span>`;}
function exTable(headers,rows){return `<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${headers.map(exH=>`<th>${exH}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(exR=>`<tr>${exR.map(exC=>`<td>${exC}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`;}
function exKV(rows){return `<dl class="kv">${rows.map(exR=>`<dt>${exR[0]}</dt><dd>${exR[1]}</dd>`).join('')}</dl>`;}
function exTabs(kind,labels){return `<div class="tabs wrap" role="tablist">${labels.map((exT,exN)=>`<button role="tab" aria-selected="${!exN}" class="${exN?'':'on'}" onclick="exTab(this,'${kind}',${exN})">${exT}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="exTabContent">${exPanel(kind,0)}</div>`;}
function exTab(button,kind,index){button.parentNode.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(exB=>{exB.classList.remove('on');exB.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');});button.classList.add('on');button.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');document.getElementById('exTabContent').innerHTML=exPanel(kind,index);exIcons();exLogFollow();}
function exPanel(kind,index){return kind==='execution'?exExecutionPanel(index):kind==='delivery'?exDeliveryPanel(index):exIntakePanel(index);}
function exMissing(kind){return head('Northwind Studio',kind+'不存在','请检查编号或返回列表。')+card('',`<div class="empty">未找到这个${kind}。</div>`);}
// 展示指纹，非真实 SHA-256；不用于验证。
function exHash(seed){let exN=2166136261;for(const exC of seed){exN=Math.imul(exN^exC.charCodeAt(0),16777619);}return Array.from({length:8},(_,exI)=>((exN+Math.imul(exI,2654435761))>>>0).toString(16).padStart(8,'0')).join('');}
function exDownload(name,text,type='text/plain;charset=utf-8'){const exUrl=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type}));const exLink=document.createElement('a');exLink.href=exUrl;exLink.download=name;exLink.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(exUrl),1000);}
function exCopy(text){if(navigator.clipboard&&window.isSecureContext){navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>toast('已复制完整值'),()=>openDrawer(card('完整值',`<div class="code" style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">${exEscape(text)}</div>`)));}else openDrawer(card('完整值 · 你可以选择并复制',`<div class="code" style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">${exEscape(text)}</div>`));}
function exModal(title,body,submit,label='确认',danger=false){openModal(`<div class="stack" style="padding:24px"><h3>${exEscape(title)}</h3>${body}<div class="row wrap" style="justify-content:flex-end">${exButton('取消','closeModal()')}${exButton(label,submit,danger?'danger':'primary')}</div></div>`);exIcons();}
function exConfirm(title,consequence,call,stepup=true,check=false){exModal(title,`<div class="note danger">${I('shield-alert')}<span>${consequence}${stepup?' 需重新认证。原型仅演示确认流程，不进行真实身份验证。':''}</span></div><label class="row"><input id="exConfirmCheck" type="checkbox">${check?'我已检查工具副作用，确认可以恢复':'我理解上述后果并确认操作'}</label>`,`exConfirmSubmit('${call}')`,'确认'+(stepup?'并演示重新认证':''),true);}
